WEBVTT

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:13.970
"December 3rd 6:49 AM
9 Days Till Launch"

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:16.930
"Solitary Confinement - Shower Room"

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.480
Good night, Irina.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.170
Irina...

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:57.360
"Irina: The Vampire Cosmonaut"

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:12.770
"Nosferatu"

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:20.200
Took you long enough.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.740
Could you not sleep?

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:22.910
Why?

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:25.030
You've got eye bags.

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:29.620
You've got worse ones than me.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:31.920
It was too cold to sleep.

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:36.000
Let's go.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:39.010
Yeah.

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:58.150
What's up with Irinyan?

00:03:58.150 --> 00:04:02.570
Who knows? Maybe she's just tired?

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:07.120
I've never seen her
like this. I'm worried.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:08.620
Yeah...

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:13.580
"Dormitory - Cafeteria"

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:20.710
Not eating?

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:22.630
I was just about to.

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:30.270
Wait!

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:31.770
This can't be good...

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:39.190
"Training Center - Hot Room"

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:50.370
You okay?

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:51.700
Yeah.

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:59.960
That's more like it! Experiment
subjects should look defeated.

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:08.680
She seems out of it today.

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:10.060
Yeah.

00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:12.520
I wonder if she can handle launch.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:13.980
Listen, you two...

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:18.310
I'm completely fine.

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:23.360
In that case, it's straight
to the next one!

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:26.530
Time for centrifuge and hypoxia training!

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:29.030
"December 4th 0:30 AM
8 Days Till Launch"

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:30.950
"Dormitory - Cafeteria"

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:31.530
"Dormitory - Cafeteria"
I heated up some borscht.

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:34.250
I heated up some borscht.

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:35.540
No thanks.

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:38.210
You only had water today.

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:40.750
I can't stomach human food.

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:43.170
It's never stopped you before.

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:48.590
Are we doing parachute
spin training today?

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:53.640
Not today, don't be stupid.
You're accident prone in that state.

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:58.900
I'm fine! Time's running out!
I'm not one of you weak humans!

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:03.020
Irina! You okay?!

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:07.150
I'm fine. I just slipped.

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:10.660
--Go see the doctor.
--I said I'm fine.

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:12.200
Enough already!

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:17.660
Push too hard and it'll all go to waste.

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:19.040
Fine.

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:22.290
"Training Center - Infirmary"

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:27.340
She's likely anemic.

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:28.550
Anemic?

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:33.600
But since she's not human,
let's just wait and see for now.

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:35.020
Roger that.

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:39.940
What happened to you?

00:06:39.940 --> 00:06:43.820
Look at the state you're in.
Answer honestly.

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:46.990
I had a bad dream.

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:48.740
A dream?

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:54.450
A rocket exploded and
I turned into ash like that dog.

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:58.040
Ever since, my body's been acting weird.

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:02.750
Good thing it's Sunday tomorrow.
Take it easy and rest.

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:03.750
Yeah.

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:23.150
Even after resting all day,
she's no better.

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:26.400
Have some of this. It's milk porridge.

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:35.990
And the doctor already gave up,
thinking human treatments won't work.

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:40.960
At this rate, she can't handle
training, let alone the launch.

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:45.210
"Blood Connection"

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:49.420
I get that she's exhausted from training,
but it seems like a mental problem.

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:53.050
"Pine Pathway"
I get that she's exhausted from training,
but it seems like a mental problem.

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:56.680
She always acts strong and hides the pain.

00:07:56.680 --> 00:08:00.600
Maybe pushing too hard caught up with her.

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:07.320
She acts all tough, but she's just 17.
And to think she's prepared to die?

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:11.990
I failed to understand her.
It's all my fault.

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:13.110
Lev!

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:22.250
Still, how does a vampire
get to be anemic?

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:27.090
She said milk's a substitute for blood,
but if she doesn't drink...

00:08:28.210 --> 00:08:30.130
Blood!

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:31.970
Delicious.

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:36.970
My body felt warm
and I was filled with strength.

00:08:36.970 --> 00:08:41.730
Blood! Hey, Anya!
What if we have her drink blood?

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:46.480
I think it's worth trying out!

00:08:46.480 --> 00:08:50.860
No! No way! I'm not drinking that!

00:08:52.530 --> 00:08:55.820
But you said blood gave you strength.

00:08:55.820 --> 00:09:00.580
But we don't know where
or what that blood came from!

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:02.080
True, but...

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:06.920
I refuse. It'll defile my body
and make me even worse.

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:08.920
But it might help.

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:11.590
I'd rather die!

00:09:11.590 --> 00:09:15.590
To think, all your effort
will be for nothing...

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:23.100
If only I hadn't taken her
to the crash site...

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:28.230
Unless I do something, Irina's dream...

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:31.020
I wanna go to space before a human!

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:35.530
If I can do that,
I don't care if I'm disposed of.

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:39.160
Irina, I...

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:52.130
Hey, what if it's my blood?

00:09:55.880 --> 00:10:00.550
If it's me, you'll at least know
where the blood came from.

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:03.770
Yeah, but...

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:05.430
So let's do it.

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:09.770
W-Well...

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:13.860
Biting my neck sounds scary,
so use my arm.

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:15.940
--Hold on!
--Huh?

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:19.780
Are you serious?

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:26.500
Yeah. I wanna do all I can to make
your dream of going to space come true.

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:35.920
Fine. I'll drink your blood.

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:36.880
Yeah.

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:41.340
U-Um! I'll make sure nobody comes in!

00:10:42.550 --> 00:10:46.020
Um, how should we do this?

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:48.060
I dunno. Up to you.

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:53.150
That doesn't really help me much.
Wait, why are you blushing?

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:54.980
Beats me.

00:10:54.980 --> 00:10:57.360
I'll pretend like it's a shot.

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:59.860
Should I brush my teeth?

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:01.200
No need.

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:04.700
I'm nervous.

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:05.990
Me, too.

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:10.960
This good?

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:12.210
Yeah.

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:18.630
Here I go.

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:07.180
You finished?

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:08.390
Yeah.

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:13.440
Wipe your mouth.

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:16.520
W-Wait! Don't look.

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:21.360
Irina, you look way less
pale now. Maybe it helped?

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:25.870
You're right. My body's warm
and I feel light again.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:28.740
Now I've got your going-to-space blessing.

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:36.000
Aren't you scared?

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.500
Of what?

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:42.550
Riding a missile into space
that might explode.

00:12:42.550 --> 00:12:48.470
I'd be lying if I said no,
but it's a dream I'd risk my life for.

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:50.720
Risk your life...

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:57.770
If there's a reason I live, it's to go
to space. I'd give up everything for it.

00:12:57.770 --> 00:12:59.980
But why go that far?

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:04.530
For lots of reasons,
but it's hard to put it in words.

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:09.530
If anything, it's the
passion to go to space.

00:13:09.530 --> 00:13:15.120
Still, yours might be more than mine.
You became an experiment to get there.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.170
I guess.

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:26.300
We don't ride missiles that kill,
but rockets that carry dreams.

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:28.430
Those don't explode.

00:13:28.430 --> 00:13:36.560
Maybe you're right. But if you're gonna
fly, you've gotta get promoted first.

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:40.820
You're grinning again!

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:45.650
You're seeing things.
Uh, I'll go bring Anya back.

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:00.090
Lev...

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:04.300
Thank you.

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:13.850
"December 5th 10:30 AM
7 Days Till Launch"
You want the launch postponed?

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:17.270
Yes, until the safety level is higher.

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:20.230
"Gergiev's Office"
Numbers don't matter.
It works or it doesn't.

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:24.570
"1st Design Bureau - Chief's Office"
Currently, the success rate is 30%.

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:27.320
If the test flight works, that's plenty.

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:30.950
But with an extra month,
there's a better chance...

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:34.240
It's not happening. The date is firm.

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:35.080
But--!

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:39.830
Just make it work by the real launch.
We make the impossible possible.

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:42.630
Isn't that right, Comrade Chief?

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:46.300
He's ignoring me.

00:14:48.170 --> 00:14:51.140
Perhaps you should rest, Chief.

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:55.930
Worry about the ship, not me!
We must succeed, whatever it takes!

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:01.190
"The Final Step to Fly"

00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:05.820
"December 6th 8:50 PM
6 Days Till Launch"

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:09.490
"Spin Parachute Training - Tandem"

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:19.790
It hurts!

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:21.920
Don't panic! Hang in there!

00:15:26.050 --> 00:15:27.300
You okay?

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:29.510
Yeah.

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:34.180
The Committee has an update
regarding the test flight.

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:39.890
They told us to put explosives
on the ship like the animal test flights.

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:43.150
Explosives? And that's final?

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:49.860
Yes. If it nears our borders, it'll be
detonated to preserve state secrets.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:56.080
To think it might be pointless,
no matter how hard she tries...

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.120
What is it?

00:15:57.120 --> 00:16:02.420
Nothing. That's it for today.
Next time, you'll go solo.

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:06.500
Tomorrow will be your
last chance to practice.

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:13.800
"Training Center - Hot Room"
Self-destruct, huh?
That's unfortunate to hear.

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:17.310
A plan this cruel should just be canceled.

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:18.220
Huh?

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:23.270
They're forcing an impossible
schedule just to beat the UK.

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:25.730
She's a sacrifice in their war.

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:28.610
You should leave it at that.

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:33.530
I think you're right,
but I want you to be a cosmonaut.

00:16:33.530 --> 00:16:36.910
So please, don't stray from the path.

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:40.500
I know. Thanks, Franz.

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:43.460
"December 7th 4:21 AM"

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:50.880
This could be the last time we drink here.

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:55.550
Hey, what was that red drink
you had at the jazz bar?

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:57.260
<i>Oleaster nastoyka?</i>

00:16:57.260 --> 00:17:02.850
Yeah, <i>nastoyka</i>! In my village,
we can drink when we're 20.

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:07.110
So on my 20th birthday,
I wanna try it again.

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:09.070
We'll celebrate, too.

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:10.320
Yeah.

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:12.860
"December 7th 5:02 PM
5 Days Till Launch"

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:15.410
"Training Center - Centrifuge Training"

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:26.120
She outlasted the
Vice-Director's bullying.

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:27.750
Now he's napping.

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:30.880
Wh-What?

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:32.880
Isn't she done yet?

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:35.180
The machine is being weird.

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:36.090
Huh?

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:41.060
Is it broken? It won't stop!

00:17:44.020 --> 00:17:45.850
She'll die at this rate!

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:48.520
Franz, stop it!

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:49.900
Shit!

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:51.320
What's all the fuss?

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:53.490
It's broken! It won't stop!

00:17:53.490 --> 00:17:54.440
Shit!

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:57.740
What do you think you're doing?!

00:17:57.740 --> 00:17:59.490
Killing the power!

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:04.790
Don't you dare!

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:07.290
I told you to stop!

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:09.460
Stop, dammit!

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:14.010
It's my duty to protect Irina!

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:24.720
It's slowing!

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:28.560
Irina...

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:34.900
Irina!

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:40.120
You okay?

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:42.160
I thought I was a goner.

00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:44.490
I'll get the doctor!

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:48.580
Do you have any idea what you've done?!

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:53.380
The machine broke 'cuz
that filth was in it! Disgusting!

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:59.340
What are you looking at?!

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:02.100
I'm staring down a pathetic human.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:06.140
What?! Who do you think you are?!

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:15.900
I guess the god of you
humans teaches violence.

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:23.200
Y-You filth! I hope you die
in space, just like that dog!

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:33.170
Stop it!

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:38.630
Now you're insulting her dreams?
Who's the filth now?!

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:41.050
You little...!

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:47.890
I'm embarrassed to be a human
when there are ones as heartless as you.

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:51.100
Don't strike Irina ever again!

00:19:57.570 --> 00:19:58.990
Apologize to her!

00:19:58.990 --> 00:20:01.280
Lev, I'm fine.

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:02.110
Do it!

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:03.280
Stop!

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:06.410
Enough.

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:11.670
Assault and battery
of a superior officer...

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:17.460
Destroying property, disobeying orders...
You'll be court-martialed!

00:20:19.130 --> 00:20:20.840
You're done for!

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:23.760
Wait! This was my fault!

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:25.140
What happened?!

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:28.850
It's all his doing! Seize him!

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:35.440
Sorry we couldn't do solo spin training,
but I know you'll be fine.

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:37.320
Lev...

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:38.940
Sorry, Franz!

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:56.750
"Solitary Confinement - Cell IV"
You're stuck here till further notice!

00:21:02.220 --> 00:21:05.220
"Space Research City 'LAIKA44'
Entrance Gate"

00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:12.180
This test flight is a state secret.

00:21:12.180 --> 00:21:17.230
Anyone who isn't in the know
thinks we're launching a mannequin.

00:21:17.230 --> 00:21:20.480
Um, what will happen to Lev?

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:25.660
Listen to me, N44. Don't wander
around the base without permission.

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:30.620
"December 8th 4:56 PM
4 Days Till Launch"

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:32.580
"Zirnitra Union - Albinar Airfield"
